<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-107.1-strategic-account-selection-planning-and-relationship-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3425" name="W3425. Strategic Account Definition, Tiering &amp; Selection Criteria" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual KAM strategy review; segment/revenue change
Frequency: Annual + periodic re-tier
Volume: ~200 corporate + ~500 top trade accounts (~40% of revenue)
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts
Participants: Head of Strategic Accounts, Head of Trade / Account Management/Trade (links to VS-11), Finance (links to VS-17.4), CRM/Master Data (links to VS-29/VS-13.3)
Source: workflow W3425 — Strategic Account Definition, Tiering &amp; Selection Criteria</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3425_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3425_Lane1" name="Head of Strategic Accounts">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3425_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3425_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3425_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3425_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3425_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3425_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3425_Start4" name="Annual KAM strategy review; segment/revenue change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3425_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3425_Task5" name="Head of Strategic Accounts define the strategic-account segmentation model…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Head of Strategic Accounts define the strategic-account segmentation model: tiering criteria (revenue, GM$, growth potential, strategic importance, complexity, credit exposure links to VS-68), tier definitions (e.g., Platinum/Gold/Silver key accounts), and the KAM-service-level per tier (dedicated team, executive sponsor, cadence); align to corporate strategy (links to VS-33) and segment plan (links to VS-11.1)
Responsible (R): Head of Strategic Accounts / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3425_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3425_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3425_Task6" name="Finance/CRM compute the account-level revenue/GM$/margin and growth analytics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/CRM compute the account-level revenue/GM$/margin and growth analytics from actuals (links to VS-17.4/VS-13.3/VS-101.3), apply the tiering criteria, and produce the candidate strategic-account list with tier assignments and exception flags
Responsible (R): Finance / CRM Analyst
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3425_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3425_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3425_Task7" name="Head of Strategic Accounts/Head of Trade / Account Management validate the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Head of Strategic Accounts/Head of Trade / Account Management validate the tiering with regional/trade leadership, approve the strategic-account roster and tier assignments, publish to account teams (W3428), and update the CRM/account master (links to VS-29/VS-13.3); set the re-tier cadence
Responsible (R): Head of Strategic Accounts / Head of Trade / Account Management
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3425_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3425_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3425_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3425_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3425_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-550 (ensure controlled execution — Strategic Account Selection, Planning &amp; Relationship Governance (PA-107.1).) | - operational: data-driven criteria and validation; operational: periodic re-tier
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3425_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3425_Annotation9" targetRef="W3425_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3425_Flow11" sourceRef="W3425_Start4" targetRef="W3425_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3425_Flow12" sourceRef="W3425_Task5" targetRef="W3425_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3425_Flow13" sourceRef="W3425_Task6" targetRef="W3425_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3425_Flow14" sourceRef="W3425_Task7" targetRef="W3425_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3425_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3425_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3425">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3425_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3425_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3425_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3425_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3425_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3425_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3425_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W3425_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3426" name="W3426. Strategic Account Identification, Qualification &amp; Onboarding to KAM" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New high-potential account (won project links to VS-11.2/VS-46); re-tier promotion; acquisition target
Frequency: Continuous + quarterly intake
Volume: ~20–40 new strategic accounts/year
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts
Participants: Head of Strategic Accounts, Account Managers, Trade/Regional Sales (links to VS-11), Credit (links to VS-16.1/VS-68), CRM (links to VS-13.3)
Source: workflow W3426 — Strategic Account Identification, Qualification &amp; Onboarding to KAM</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3426_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3426_Lane1" name="Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3426_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3426_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3426_Lane2" name="Head of Strategic Accounts">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3426_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3426_Lane3" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3426_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3426_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3426_Start5" name="New high-potential account (won project links to VS-11.2/VS-46); re-tier promotion…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3426_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3426_Task6" name="Sales/Account Managers identify and qualify candidate strategic accounts: fit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales/Account Managers identify and qualify candidate strategic accounts: fit with tiering criteria (W3425), growth potential, strategic value, decision-maker access, credit-worthiness (links to VS-16.1/VS-68), and competitive position; document the qualification rationale and opportunity size
Responsible (R): Sales / Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3426_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3426_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3426_Task7" name="Head of Strategic Accounts approve onboarding to the KAM program, assign the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Head of Strategic Accounts approve onboarding to the KAM program, assign the account team and executive sponsor (W3428), set up the account in CRM (links to VS-13.3) with tier/service-level, and ensure credit/contract/CRM master alignment (links to VS-29/VS-16.1)
Responsible (R): Head of Strategic Accounts / CRM
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3426_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3426_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3426_Task8" name="Account Manager conduct the onboarding meeting with the customer: introduce the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager conduct the onboarding meeting with the customer: introduce the account team and sponsor, confirm mutual expectations and cadence (W3430), kick off the Key Account Plan (W3427), and integrate any active projects/orders (links to VS-11.2/VS-46) into the account view
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Sponsor
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3426_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3426_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3426_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3426_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3426_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-550 (ensure controlled execution — Strategic Account Selection, Planning &amp; Relationship Governance (PA-107.1).) | - operational: clear criteria and review; operational: clear ownership and coordination (W3431)
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3426_Assoc11" sourceRef="W3426_Annotation10" targetRef="W3426_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3426_Flow12" sourceRef="W3426_Start5" targetRef="W3426_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3426_Flow13" sourceRef="W3426_Task6" targetRef="W3426_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3426_Flow14" sourceRef="W3426_Task7" targetRef="W3426_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3426_Flow15" sourceRef="W3426_Task8" targetRef="W3426_End9" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3426_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3426_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3426">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3426_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3426_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3426_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3426_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3426_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W3426_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3426_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3426_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
