    <bpmn:process id="W_W3429" name="W3429. Strategic Account Relationship Map &amp; Stakeholder Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: KAP development (W3427); account change/issue
Frequency: Continuous + per KAP refresh
Volume: ~5–20 stakeholders per strategic account
Owner: Account Manager
Participants: Account Manager, Executive Sponsor, CRM (links to VS-13.3), Customer stakeholders
Source: workflow W3429 — Strategic Account Relationship Map &amp; Stakeholder Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3429_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3429_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3429_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3429_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3429_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3429_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3429_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3429_Start3" name="KAP development (W3427); account change/issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3429_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3429_Task4" name="Account Manager build the account relationship map: identify all key…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager build the account relationship map: identify all key stakeholders (decision-makers, influencers, users, blockers, procurement/finance), their roles, power/interest, sentiment, BuildRight counterpart, and relationship strength; capture in CRM (links to VS-13.3)
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3429_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3429_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3429_Task5" name="Account Manager/Sponsor develop the stakeholder engagement plan: coverage of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account Manager/Sponsor develop the stakeholder engagement plan: coverage of each stakeholder by the right BuildRight counterpart, relationship-building actions, gap-closure (uncovered/weak stakeholders), and exec-to-exec engagement for top stakeholders; execute against the plan
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Sponsor
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3429_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3429_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3429_Task6" name="Account Manager monitor stakeholder changes (turnover, reorg, sentiment shift)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager monitor stakeholder changes (turnover, reorg, sentiment shift), update the map, and trigger escalation/relationship-recovery (links to W3446) where a key stakeholder is at-risk or hostile; feed insights to the KAP (W3427) and governance review (W3430)
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3429_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3429_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3429_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3429_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
