        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-550 (ensure controlled execution — Strategic Account Selection, Planning &amp; Relationship Governance (PA-107.1).) | - operational: multi-stakeholder coverage; operational: thorough mapping and refresh
Owner: Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
