    <bpmn:process id="W_W3430" name="W3430. Account Governance Cadence: QBR, Operating Reviews &amp; Joint Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Established cadence per tier
Frequency: Quarterly (QBR) + monthly/weekly operating reviews
Volume: ~700 accounts across tiers
Owner: Account Manager
Participants: Account Manager, Sponsor, Customer counterparts, internal specialists
Source: workflow W3430 — Account Governance Cadence: QBR, Operating Reviews &amp; Joint Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3430_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3430_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3430_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3430_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3430_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3430_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3430_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3430_Start3" name="Established cadence per tier">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3430_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3430_Task4" name="Account Manager prepare the operating review: performance vs KAP/JBP targets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager prepare the operating review: performance vs KAP/JBP targets (revenue, GM$, share, projects, service-levels links to VS-67/VS-06), open issues/actions, pipeline (links to VS-11.2), credit/AR status (links to VS-16/VS-68), and risks; meet customer monthly/weekly per tier
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Monthly/Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3430_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3430_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3430_Task5" name="Account Manager/Sponsor conduct the Quarterly Business Review (QBR) with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account Manager/Sponsor conduct the Quarterly Business Review (QBR) with customer decision-makers: performance review, strategic alignment, pipeline/pipeline-conversion, joint initiatives, escalations, and forward plan; capture minutes, actions, and commitments
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Sponsor
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3430_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3430_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3430_Task6" name="Account Manager cascade QBR outcomes to internal teams (W3431), update the KAP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager cascade QBR outcomes to internal teams (W3431), update the KAP (W3427) and CRM (links to VS-13.3), track action closure, and report account-health and at-risk signals to the account-governance review (links to VS-33.2) and retention workflow (W3446)
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3430_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3430_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3430_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3430_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
